'''fibreglass'''

# silica based glass [[extrude]]d into [[fiber]]s that possess a length at least 1000 times greater than their width.
# a composite material made from [[fine]] [[fibre]]s of [[spun]] [[glass]] held together with [[resin]]. (Also called Glass-Reinforced Plastic.)

